


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_b801e4fb:


    "周日下午，阳菜和伦出门上街了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_25c741d4:



    voice "2RI_0954"
    rin "「呼……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_5bb7ba27:


    "伦小声叹了口气，表情略显疲惫。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_02c54893:



    voice "2HI_0992"
    hina "「累了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_58a8082b:


    "见伦在叹气，阳菜抬头看向她。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_5797337c:



    voice "2RI_0955"
    rin "「有点吧……呜哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_2fc5360b:


    "伦的手腕突然被一股怪力往前拉，导致她失去了平衡。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_f64a2b55:



    voice "2AR_0002"
    arthur "「汪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_fb21a90d:


    "这险些让伦摔倒的怪力，来自浅生家的宠物狗亚瑟。毕竟快成年的金毛寻回犬的体型很大。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_2eec1792:



    voice "2HI_0993"
    hina "「亚瑟，不是那边。家在这边」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_8981d155:


    "阳菜这样说后，亚瑟乖乖地顺从指示，沿着之前的路走了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_5ba1eedd:


    "伦牵着狗绳，小跑跟随其后。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_4e02472d:



    voice "2RI_0956"
    rin "「……抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_39c4e80c:



    voice "2HI_0994"
    hina "「嗯？什么事？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_0cb9085d:



    voice "2RI_0957"
    rin "「呃，说好了去约会结果变成了陪亚瑟散步」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_04adff0c:



    voice "2HI_0995"
    hina "「原来就这件事啊。但是答应浅生的是我啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_ba426c0e:


    "家里经营的点心店忙不过来，文只好拜托阳菜她们带亚瑟散步。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_22921dbf:



    voice "2RI_0958"
    rin "「但是，我真的计划了很多活动哦。比如去那里，比如去那家店……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_8e0e8d19:


    "毕竟她很注重形式和排场。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_80e43d50:



    voice "2HI_0996"
    hina "「啊哈，你考虑了很多啊。有这份心我就很开心啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_3dd159a7:



    voice "2RI_0959"
    rin "「呃、嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_e630b909:


    "伦被阳菜爽朗的笑容打败了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_bf2e4d23:



    voice "2HI_0997"
    hina "「而且陪亚瑟散步也很有意思啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_7e52901c:



    voice "2RI_0960"
    rin "「我是第一次在公园陪狗玩」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_c7e7a509:



    voice "2HI_0998"
    hina "「亚瑟很聪明，丢东西取东西的游戏它也玩得很好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_f64a2b55_1:



    voice "2AR_0002"
    arthur "「汪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_dba8bb71:



    voice "2RI_0961"
    rin "「我佩服的不仅是亚瑟的智慧，还有你的体力」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_3ac4af39:



    voice "2HI_0999"
    hina "「是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_957f2cce:



    voice "2RI_0962"
    rin "「明明是给亚瑟扔的球，结果阳菜也跟着一起跑出去了。实际上你的运动量和亚瑟不是没差嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_190f5c5b:



    voice "2HI_1000"
    hina "「啊哈哈，一不留神就一起跑了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_305572e7:



    voice "2RI_0963"
    rin "「就像是带着两条狗。大型猎犬和豆柴」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_57cccbf4:



    voice "2HI_1001"
    hina "「不准说“豆”」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_dd44aaf5:


    "那你是默认了柴犬的部分啊。嘛，毕竟本人自称是伦的狗。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_e5a38499:



    voice "2RI_0964"
    rin "「说起来，所有狗当中，柴犬的DNA是最接近狼的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_d2860aee:



    voice "2HI_1002"
    hina "「狼吗？听上去有点帅气诶」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_eb2ebcb3:



    voice "2RI_0965B"
    rin "「我觉得有点可怕」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_0bd7e8ba:



    voice "2AR_0001"
    arthur "「汪汪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_4597b7d2:



    voice "2RI_0966"
    rin "「呜哇哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_902f25c3:


    "又被亚瑟牵着跑了。似乎是对面的狗引起了它的注意。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_837ee87d:



    voice "2RI_0967"
    rin "「等、等等、停下！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_59819484:


    "被大型犬带跑的伦只能苦苦哀求。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_baa1ef2f:



    voice "2HI_1003"
    hina "「绳子给我」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_b3b38b2d:


    "阳菜伸手准备接绳。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_11d1b328:



    voice "2RI_0968"
    rin "「诶，阳菜会被亚瑟牵着跑吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_866e79d7:


    "毕竟个头远超阳菜的自己都如此狼狈……会这么想也很正常。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_b86a660b:



    voice "2HI_1004"
    hina "「没事的啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_98e67bce:


    "但阳菜自信满满地从伦手中接过了狗绳。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_203678da:



    voice "2HI_1005"
    hina "「停下！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_62533a6a:


    "阳菜轻轻拉了拉绳子引起亚瑟注意后，竖起手指给出了命令。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_f64a2b55_2:



    voice "2AR_0002"
    arthur "「汪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_9df1186c:


    "与伦的预想相反，亚瑟乖乖地服从了阳菜的命令。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_fb3c2804:



    voice "2RI_0969"
    rin "「啊咧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_f6203ad0:



    voice "2HI_1006"
    hina "「好的亚瑟，趴下」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_ea975f3f:


    "将亚瑟稳在原地后，阳菜将绳子还给伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_c9185035:



    voice "2HI_1007"
    hina "「伦太情绪化了。如果你一惊一乍的话，亚瑟也会陷入混乱」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_7f9ed6e4:



    voice "2RI_0970"
    rin "「唔、嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_a98b85a0:


    "狗继承了狼的群居习性，会给家庭成员排序，不会听从比自己地位低的一方。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_730087e7:


    "亚瑟这次的举动也是同理。阳菜接触它的态度很坚决，所以被视为地位更高而表示服从；但伦的态度暧昧，亚瑟也就难以决定她的地位顺序了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_cf381830:



    voice "2HI_1008"
    hina "「我老家也养过大型犬，是那个时候习惯的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_5565d9e7:



    voice "2RI_0971"
    rin "「这样啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_34a8810e:


    "听完阳菜的解释，伦还是感到不安。毕竟她怕生——无论对方是人是狗。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_705a104d:



    voice "2HI_1009"
    hina "「亚瑟是很乖巧、很聪明的孩子哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_511c1a23:


    "阳菜说着，摸了摸亚瑟的背。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_f64a2b55_3:



    voice "2AR_0002"
    arthur "「汪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_9ab7517f:



    voice "2RI_0972"
    rin "「阳菜也聪明吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_ccc59dbb:



    voice "2HI_1010"
    hina "「那当然！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_c31f53ba:



    voice "2RI_0973"
    rin "「伸手」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_66fee872:



    voice "2HI_1011"
    hina "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_c7d190dd:



    voice "2RI_0974"
    rin "「换手」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_062968fd:



    voice "2HI_1012"
    hina "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_fc44971b:


    "阳菜迅速将自己的手放在伦伸出的手上。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_ab658541:



    voice "2RI_0975"
    rin "「起立。转圈」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_2adb2e73:



    voice "2HI_1013"
    hina "「转啊转～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_30d293ff:


    "阳菜忽地站起，围着伦打转。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_a9e39c9b:



    voice "2RI_0976"
    rin "「趴下——还是算了，衣服会弄脏的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_d93da126:



    voice "2HI_1014"
    hina "「哦哦哦……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_00f723b9:


    "阳菜毫不犹豫地执行着荒唐的命令，施令的伦不由慌了神。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_5fc1a6a5:



    voice "2HI_1015"
    hina "「怎么样，聪不聪明？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_23da4c9a:


    "阳菜的脸上挂着得意的笑容。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_c9ceaea9:



    voice "2RI_0977"
    rin "「与其说是聪明……不如说没想到你真的会照做」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_80238305:



    voice "2HI_1016"
    hina "「因为现在戴着项圈嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_72ca4aa2:


    "阳菜说着，扯开了自己的领口，脖子上的choker若隐若现。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_fd0af4ed:



    voice "2RI_0978"
    rin "「……啊、嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_938c0575:



    voice "2HI_1017"
    hina "「嗯？怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_63d76bb8:



    voice "2RI_0979"
    rin "「砰！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_2d48ab30:


    "伦朝阳菜伸出食指、开了枪。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_532c9675:



    voice "2HI_1018"
    hina "「唔啊啊啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_cdeaaa4c:



    voice "2AR_0001"
    arthur "「汪～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_db2d2919:


    "阳菜和亚瑟像是被击中般转着圈。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_e4782ecb:



    voice "2RI_0980"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_03_31c5f320:


    "而伦的枪口并没有飘出白烟——取而代之的是松了的创可贴。"
